		(property "Note" "GNSS antenna bias feed inductor. 27 nH matches u-blox's recommended L3 value exactly. The requirement behind it is not a value to round: the inductor must resonate at L1 frequency to present >500 ohm series impedance so the feed point does not load the 50 ohm line, and must be rated above 300 mA. Pairs with C16 as the bias-T."
			(at -40.64 13.97 0)
			(hide yes)
