		(property "Note" "GNSS RF DC block. 15pF is SRF-tuned, not arbitrary: an 0402's ~0.6nH mounted ESL resonates near 1.575 GHz at this value, so series impedance nearly vanishes. A larger cap is NOT safer here - above SRF the ESL dominates and 10nF would present ~9 ohm. C0G for Q."
