		(property "Note" "BOM line is the CONNECTOR (JST SM02B-SRSS-TB). REV 2.1 REVERSES REV 2.0's POLARITY: the cell's + is on PAD 2 (to D2's anode), - on PAD 1 (GND). Rev 2.0 had + on pad 1, and the lead fitted to it had + on pin 2, so the receiver cold-started every boot (13.5.6). JST-SH leads have no standard polarity: meter the lead (+ on housing pin 2) before fitting, and mark '+' beside pad 2 in the silkscreen at layout. The cell must be a primary cell: there is no charge path."
			(at 74.2315 53.34 0)
			(hide yes)
