		(property "Note" "GNSS antenna, U.FL receptacle (rev 2.1, replaces the rev 2.0 edge SMA that collided with the Pi 5 USB ports - CANary-HAT-Rev2.1.md 13.5.7 option B). The antenna connects through a ~10 cm 1.13 mm U.FL-to-SMA bulkhead pigtail (off-board BOM). U.FL holds by friction and is rated ~30 mating cycles: mate it once at assembly, strain-relieve the pigtail next to the receptacle, and connect/disconnect the antenna at the bulkhead SMA. Keep the 50 ohm feed to U7 RF_IN over solid In1.Cu."
			(at -40.64 13.97 0)
			(hide yes)
